    "Limits only apply when you add things. If Pro ends or you get a refund, you can still see, edit and export everything you've saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Limits only apply when you add things. If Pro ends or you get a refund, you can still see, edit and export everything you've saved."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los límites solo se aplican al añadir cosas. Si Pro termina o recibes un reembolso, puedes seguir viendo, editando y exportando todo lo que guardaste."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les limites ne s’appliquent qu’à l’ajout. Si Pro se termine ou si vous obtenez un remboursement, vous pouvez toujours voir, modifier et exporter tout ce que vous avez enregistré."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os limites só valem ao adicionar coisas. Se o Pro acabar ou você for reembolsado, ainda pode ver, editar e exportar tudo o que salvou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
